# This project does not use a .env file directly.
# Instead, API keys are stored as plain text files in the "APIkeys/" directory
#
# Please refer to README.md and create the following files manually before running the project:
#
#   APIkeys/matches_key.txt
#       - Contains your football-data.org API key (one line, no extra spaces)
#       - Obtain a free key at: https://www.football-data.org/
#
#   APIkeys/X_bearertoken.txt
#       - Contains your X (formerly Twitter) API v2 Bearer Token (one line, no extra spaces)
#       - Obtain a token at: https://developer.x.com/
#       - Note: Using the X API to scrape a full season of tweets costs approximately $60–$70 in credits.
#
# Directory structure expected:
#
#   APIkeys/
#   ├── matches_key.txt      ← your football-data.org API key
#   └── X_bearertoken.txt    ← your X API Bearer Token
